      "content": "It sounds incredibly draining to feel trapped by external expectations and unable to live authentically. Please remember that your worth isn't defined by what others expect, and seeking a space to just be yourself is a healthy and brave step. Talking to a trusted friend or a counselor can help you find those tools to set boundaries and breathe a little more easily. You deserve to live a life that feels like truly yours, and that change starts with acknowledging your true feelings.",
